  "description": "DIPMEW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H70 Dy4 N6 O20,2(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.523-3.912 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.29-111.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)2(L)4(HL)2]·2THF (C92H86Dy4N6O22). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Dy(III).",
